OL,3,APM in Brussels to agree new UK-EU deal
OL,4,Acovering youth mobility, food exports
OL,5,Aand carbon emissions
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham is in Brussels where he's
OL,8,Ftrying to get a UK-EU deal over the
OL,9,Fline
OL,11,FThe agreement will cover issues such as
OL,12,Fyouth mobility - a new scheme is
OL,13,Fexpected to allow 100,000 young people
OL,14,Ffrom the EU to travel, work and study
OL,15,Fin the UK per year. The same number of
OL,16,Fyoung Britons would be allowed into
OL,17,FEurope
OL,19,FDowning Street has not commented on the
OL,20,Fdetails, with deals on food exports,
OL,21,Fcarbon emissions and migration also on
OL,22,Fthe table
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
