OL,3,A'I tell my son it's just fireworks':
OL,4,ALife inside Yemeni city besieged by
OL,5,AHouthis
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the Yemeni city of Taiz, ringed by
OL,8,Fjagged mountains and Houthi rebel
OL,9,Ffighters, Ashwaq has only one way to
OL,10,Ftry to soothe her frightened child -
OL,11,Flie.
OL,13,F"When my 11-year-old son hears a loud
OL,14,Fsound, I tell him, 'Don't be afraid,
OL,15,Fit's just fireworks'," she says. "I
OL,16,Fdon't want him to panic, but deep down
OL,17,FI know he is old enough to understand
OL,18,Fwhat is happening around him. He has
OL,19,Flived through war for most of his
OL,20,Flife."
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
